      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "That feeling of emptiness, of a life that used to have light, is a profound kind of despair. It makes perfect sense that you question the effort when the source of your joy feels extinguished. Sometimes, the \"new reality\" isn't about finding something *new* to feel alive with, but about finding a way to gently let the light of *what was* continue to exist inside you, even in the dark. Please consider speaking with someone who can help you navigate this deep void.",
      "source": "target",
